      <p class='instructor-card__role'>Seasonal Camps Lead</p>
      <p class='instructor-card__bio'>
        Multi-disciplinary teaching artist. Leads our summer + spring camps and oversees the gardening track.
      </p>
      <a class='instructor-card__link' href='instructor.html?name=courtney-henry'
        >View bio <i class='ph ph-arrow-right' aria-hidden='true'></i
