      <p class='instructor-card__bio'>Conservatory-trained pianist; founded the music track in 2019.</p>
      <a class='instructor-card__link' href='instructor.html?name=darrell-steward'
        >View bio <i class='ph ph-arrow-right' aria-hidden='true'></i
